{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05792","headline":"嵩山十志十首 其八 · 卢鸿一","name":"嵩山十志十首 其八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青崖阴兮月磵曲，重幽叠邃兮隐沦躅。\n草树緜幂兮翠蒙茏，当其无兮庭在中。\n当无有用兮幂翠庭，神可谷兮道可冥。\n有幽人兮张素琴，皇徽兮绿水阴，德之愔兮澹多心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢鸿一","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05792.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05792","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}